== 1. authorization request (the browser is sent here)
http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/auth
  ?response_type=code
  &client_id=harbor-storefront
  &redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8090%2Fcallback
  &scope=openid+orders%3Aread+orders%3Awrite
  &state=sR5fuFVflFvnMqXwgXqYiA
  &nonce=5P5wwwPAjgrRuNSLSiYGWw
  &code_challenge=XB0FnRp7SNQCB5bg32GAxaqr2KKlGArBqsHcqrvTmoU
  &code_challenge_method=S256

== 2. redirect back to the storefront
http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback?state=sR5fuFVflFvnMqXwgXqYiA&session_state=SY7jL-hugQv0fwc__DDfLXRG&iss=http://127.0.0.1:8080/realms/harbor&code=<98 chars>

== 3. the token request with the code verifier
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&
code=<98 chars>&
redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback&
client_id=harbor-storefront&
code_verifier=<43 chars>

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "access_token": "<JWT 1087 chars>",
  "expires_in": 300,
  "refresh_expires_in": 1800,
  "refresh_token": "<JWT 781 chars>",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "id_token": "<JWT 1055 chars>",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "session_state": "SY7jL-hugQv0fwc__DDfLXRG",
  "scope": "openid orders:read orders:write profile"
}

ID token checked (signature, iss, aud, azp, exp, nonce): rosa

== 4. a second login's code with the wrong code verifier
POST /realms/harbor/protocol/openid-connect/token HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8080
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&
code=<98 chars>&
redirect_uri=http://127.0.0.1:8090/callback&
client_id=harbor-storefront&
code_verifier=<43 chars>

HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
cache-control: no-store
content-type: application/json

{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "PKCE verification failed: Code mismatch"
}
